### Campaign 1: Tribal School Renovation (Monetary)
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-campaign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rebuilding ZP School Classrooms",
  "description": "Funding required to repair the roof and walls of a primary school before the monsoons.",
  "category": "Education",
  "campaignType": "MONETARY",
  "startDate": "2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-05-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "address": {
    "city": "Karjat",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "country": "India",
    "landmark": "Khandpe Village"
  },
  "monetary": {
    "targetAmount": 350000,
    "minDonation": 500
  }
}

### Campaign 2: Monsoon Gear Distribution (Goods)
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-campaign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Raincoats and Umbrellas for Students",
  "description": "Collecting rain gear so children in remote villages don't miss school during heavy rains.",
  "category": "Child Welfare",
  "campaignType": "GOODS",
